  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e18ba371",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 任务 2：Device API 分页采集\n",
    "\n",
    "API 分页结构：\n",
    "- 当前页：`page`\n",
    "- 每页条数：`page_size`\n",
    "- 设备总数：`total`\n",
    "- 设备列表：`items`\n",
    "\n",
    "总页数通过 `ceil(total/page_size)` 计算，不写死。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "8cce611f",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-10T07:57:27.176578Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-10T07:57:27.176346Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-10T07:57:27.179543Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-10T07:57:27.179028Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "total: 5000\n",
      "page_size: 50\n",
      "total_pages: 100\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# 2.1 用第一页响应读取分页信息\n",
    "total = data[\"total\"]\n",
    "page_size = data[\"page_size\"]\n",
    "total_pages = (total + page_size - 1) // page_size\n",
    "print(\"total:\", total)\n",
    "print(\"page_size:\", page_size)\n",
    "print(\"total_pages:\", total_pages)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "230b229c",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-10T07:57:27.180748Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-10T07:57:27.180571Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-10T07:57:34.900270Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-10T07:57:34.898666Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
